---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../../components/Hero.astro';
import ProductGrid from '../../components/ProductGrid.astro';
import FAQAccordion from '../../components/FAQAccordion.astro';
import QuoteForm from '../../components/quote/QuoteForm.tsx';
import { serviceSchema } from '../../lib/schema/service';
import { faqPageSchema } from '../../lib/schema/faqPage';
import { getAllProducts } from '../../data/catalog/shopify';
import '../../styles/quote-form.css';

const allProducts = await getAllProducts();
const products = allProducts.filter((p) => p.tags.includes('themed') || p.tags.includes('backdrop')).slice(0, 9);

const faqs = (await getCollection('faq'))
  .filter((f) => f.data.pages.includes('photo-booth'))
  .sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order)
  .map((f) => ({ question: f.data.question, body: f.body.trim() }));

const schemas = [
  serviceSchema({
    name: 'Photo booth balloon setups',
    description:
      'Balloon backdrops and props built around photo booth areas for events in London Ontario.',
    startingPrice: 249,
    url: '/services/photo-booth',
  }),
];
if (faqs.length > 0) {
  schemas.push(faqPageSchema(faqs.map((f) => ({ question: f.question, answer: f.body }))));
}
---

<BaseLayout
  topic="Photo Booth Balloon Setups"
  description="Photo booth balloon backdrops in London Ontario. Sized to your booth's frame and built in colours that photograph clean under booth lighting. From $249."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { name: 'Services', url: '/services' },
    { name: 'Photo booth setups', url: '/services/photo-booth' },
  ]}
  schemas={schemas}
>
  <Hero
    eyebrow="Install type"
    headline="Photo booth balloon setups in London, Ontario"
    subhead="Built around the booth rather than beside it. Sized to the camera's frame and in colours that hold up under booth lighting."
    primaryCta={{ href: '/quote', label: 'Start a quote' }}
    secondaryCta={{ href: '/portfolio', label: 'See booth work' }}
    image="/images/categories/walls-backdrops.webp"
    imageAlt="Photo booth balloon backdrop"
    variant="page"
  />

  <section class="install-body section">
    <div class="container container-narrow prose">
      <p>
        A photo booth backdrop has a harder job than a regular backdrop, because it has to work through
        a specific lens at a fixed distance under a flash. Colours that look right in the room can go
        flat or blow out on camera, and a backdrop built to look good standing in front of it often
        crops badly once the booth frames the shot.
      </p>

      <h2>What photo booth setups cost</h2>
      <p>
        A backdrop sized to a standard booth frame starts at $249. Setups with a themed build, props, or
        a name and neon accent run $349 to $699. Larger open-air booth walls that need to cover a wider
        frame land past $699. If you are already booking a balloon install elsewhere at the same event,
        a booth backdrop built at the same time costs less than booking it on its own, since it shares
        the same delivery and setup trip.
      </p>

      <h2>Building for the camera, not the room</h2>
      <p>
        Enclosed booths usually frame tight, so the backdrop needs to fill roughly eight feet wide by
        eight tall and no more, since anything past that is out of frame and wasted. Open-air booths
        shoot wider and take groups, which means ten to twelve feet to keep people off the edges.
      </p>
      <p>
        Colour behaves differently under a booth flash than under room light. Deep saturated tones hold
        up. Very pale pastels can wash out, and chrome and metallic finishes throw hot spots straight
        back at the lens. We build with that in mind, and if you tell us the booth vendor or send a
        photo of the booth, we can size and colour for that specific setup. Placement matters too, since
        a backdrop needs clear floor in front of it for the booth to sit at the right distance.
      </p>

      <h2>Working alongside your booth vendor</h2>
      <p>
        Booth companies typically arrive an hour or two before guests and need the corner clear when they
        do. We schedule our setup to finish before they start, so nobody is working around anybody. If
        you give us the booth company's name when you book, Brenda coordinates the timing with them
        directly rather than leaving you to relay it.
      </p>
      <p>
        Sizing detail is in the <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>. If you want a backdrop for general photos rather
        than a booth specifically, that is a <a href="/services/walls-backdrops">balloon wall</a>. For a
        fully themed concept built around a character or palette, see
        <a href="/services/custom-themed">custom themed installs</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {products.length > 0 && (
    <section class="install-products section">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="section-head">
          <p class="eyebrow">Shop the catalog</p>
          <h2>Booth-friendly builds in the catalog</h2>
          <p class="lede">Starting points we can resize to your booth's frame.</p>
        </header>
        <ProductGrid products={products} columns={3} />
        <p class="section-link-wrap">
          <a class="section-link" href="https://shop.balloonia.events/collections/themed-setups">View all themed setups →</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  )}

  {faqs.length > 0 && <FAQAccordion heading="Photo booth backdrop questions" faqs={faqs} />}

  <section class="install-quote section">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Custom build</p>
        <h2>Know your booth already?</h2>
        <p class="lede">Send the booth type or vendor and your colours. Brenda sizes it and quotes within 24 hours.</p>
      </header>
      <QuoteForm client:load />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .prose p { color: var(--color-ink-soft); font-size: var(--font-size-lg); line-height: var(--line-relaxed); }
  .prose h2 { margin-top: var(--space-6); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); }
  .prose a { color: var(--color-accent-deep); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .section-head { margin-bottom: var(--space-6); }
  .install-quote { background: var(--color-paper-soft); }
  .section-link { color: var(--color-accent-deep); font-size: var(--font-size-sm); font-weight: 500; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .section-link-wrap { margin-top: var(--space-5); }
</style>
